    "title": "This House is not a Home",
    "description": "Game for 2019 Global Game Jam where the theme was \"What does home mean to you?\" Developed in Unity. For many people home is a place of happiness where you can relax and enjoy life. This is not true for everyone. This is a game where you play as a young boy in a broken home. You must complete task and chores to keep your Dad from becoming too angry all the while trying to escape the house by calling for help. ",
