   {
    "title": "BTB: Behind the Backhoes",
    "description": "A motivation project done with a friend. We were striving to see how much we could get done in a two week period over Christmas break. Developed with Unity. The game is a multiplayer game where player control a Backhoe and play lacrosse. The backhoes drive over the ball to scoop and catapult the ball into the goal. ",
